TI  - Know Before You Speak: Supporting Global Team Formation with Social Profile Displays in Virtual Environments
AU  - Zhu, Qingxiaoyang
AU  - Rodolico, Angela
AU  - Yamashita, Naomi
AU  - Wang, Hao-Chuan
